{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793804059855235001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"soot-ammonitic-redpoll","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"62baa7ab5ad0253b0f0c617e011abca2c151b67d1acad346009e2578c254d339","event_uuid":"61e6b4bb-3b9e-4677-b3f6-dec7fc7b6442","position":{"commit_sha":"b2f1ec71042678d0d0ad6778689b119e441f5423","position":"1793798037827443001-61e6b4bb-3b9e-4677-b3f6-dec7fc7b6442"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"26f8583eef2bac07067d2a85f1dd97045ac917cec7086efac10b054bd3efb4a8","event_uuid":"f42703d1-feb3-409d-8dbc-b8f63328aab7","position":{"commit_sha":"777a3b69c14b98f5c352003c324f8ac9554a5e97","position":"1793798106515764001-f42703d1-feb3-409d-8dbc-b8f63328aab7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793798037827443001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f42703d1-feb3-409d-8dbc-b8f63328aab7","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"eac3-3f1b-69bb-414e"}],"description":"## Problem\nIn the rebar-mcp container the tracker is `/var/gerrit/site/mcp-tickets` (the shared `gerrit_mcp_tickets` volume), so `StorePaths(tracker).rebar_dir` is `/var/gerrit/site/.rebar`, which is on each container's writable layer (confirmed read-only over SSM on 2026-11-04: not mounted, absent 11 minutes after start). `exemplary-silty-tuatara` moved the compaction lock and stamp off it. Other store-wide sidecars still live there:\n- `hlc.state` / `hlc.lock` (src/rebar/_store/hlc.py): the store clock's cache and its read-modify-write lock. It is reset on each deploy, and the blue and green containers each hold their own lock over one store during the overlap.\n- the recent-creates journal and its lock (src/rebar/_commands/recent_creates.py): reset on each deploy, and not shared across the overlap.\n\nUnverified: whether either causes an observable defect. The HLC takes `max(state, witness, physical_now) + 1`, so a reset may be harmless; the recent-creates journal's consumers and their tolerance for a reset have not been read.\n\n## Approach\nRead each consumer and decide, per sidecar, whether a per-container reset or a split lock matters. Where it does, key it on the store, following `exemplary-silty-tuatara` (the tracker's git dir) or `intangible-ladyish-vicuna`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] For each of `hlc.state`/`hlc.lock` and the recent-creates journal, the ticket records whether a per-container reset or split lock affects behaviour, with evidence.\n- [ ] Every sidecar found to matter is store-scoped and shared by both MCP containers, with a regression test where 2 processes over one store have different `.rebar` dirs.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1237-b65b-d7d2-4565","ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP .rebar sidecars beyond compaction reset per deploy","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["61e6b4bb-3b9e-4677-b3f6-dec7fc7b6442","f42703d1-feb3-409d-8dbc-b8f63328aab7"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793804059855235001,"uuid":"ed039ff5-f680-44b5-8d7f-b4485f304725"}